      "description": {
        "en": "Glacier-slate HUD skin with ice-blue accents for the DSH web client. It recolors surfaces, borders, focus and selection, uses frosted-glass menus (translucent panels with a blur), and keeps a warm reactor core only in the brand mark and the boot sequence. Use Settings → General → Jarvis HUD to switch the skin, set the boot policy, choose the tempo or replay the sequence; the skin is presentation only and sends nothing to external services. Light mode is a frosted paper-white variant.",
        "zh": "冰川石板色 HUD 皮肤，冰蓝强调色。会重绘表面、边框、焦点与选中态，菜单/浮层使用磨砂玻璃质感（半透明面板 + 模糊），暖金只出现在品牌标记与启动动画的核心。在「设置 → 通用 → Jarvis 界面」里可以开关皮肤、设置启动策略、调整节奏或重播动画；皮肤只影响显示，不向外部服务发送数据。浅色模式为结霜纸白变体。"
      },
